      "sourceTextSha256": "2bda1fc1f1ddc3b882bb34584f2a6d3044039d0db9276f3f998055b047a86fb5",
      "text": "Day 5 · Transfer to the airport for your flight to Rio, where your driver meets you and accompanies you to Visconde de Mauá, high in the Serra da Mantiqueira, along a scenic mountain road. The village lies in a fertile valley of fruit trees, vegetable gardens, waterfalls and clean air, where you stay in a pousada, a traditional cottage in the Atlantic Forest (from the Portuguese “pousar”, to land or to rest), with river-water pool and panoramic hot tub: listen to the birds at dawn, swim in the crystal-clear river or simply relax.",
